cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ridi-check
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. The manuscript is under
  review and is not yet a publication. Cite that work as under review.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: NooR
    given-names: Professor
    affiliation: King Abdulaziz University
repository-code: https://github.com/adeebnoor/ridi-check
url: https://adeebnoor.github.io/ridi-check/
abstract: >-
  Compare two versions of a retrieval-augmented assistant on matched items.
  Repeated runs estimate an execution floor (re-execution noise). The release
  gate is an application of the item-level labels. This version does not
  compute the manuscript's exact test.
keywords:
  - evaluation
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - execution floor
  - repeated runs
  - matched items
license: MIT
